{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"ul5_kh4_xyv","canonical_person_id":"ul5_kh4_xyv","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["ul5_kh4_xyv"],"persons":[{"id":"ul5_kh4_xyv","label":"趙驤","status":"provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"趙驤","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0181"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005","mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0181","quote":"趙驤"}],"identity_note":"本篇明名來源人物；未以同名字形接到其他時代人物。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0181"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0181","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0181"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"ul5_kh4_xyv","surname":"趙","ming":"驤","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005","quote":"志字子道，初辟公府掾、尚書郎，出為鄴令。成都王穎之鎮鄴也，愛其才量，委以心膂，遂為謀主。齊王冏起義，遣使告穎。穎召志計事，志曰：「趙王無道，肆行篡逆，四海人神，莫不憤怒。今殿下總率三軍，應期電發，子來之眾，不召自至。掃夷凶逆，必有征無戰。然兵事至重，聖人所慎。宜旌賢任才，以收時望。」穎深然之，改選上佐，高辟掾屬，以志為諮議參軍，仍補左長史，專掌文翰。穎前鋒都督趙驤為倫所敗，士眾震駭，議者多欲還保朝歌。志曰：「今我軍失利，敵新得勝，必有輕易陵轢之情，若頓兵不進，三軍畏衄，懼不可用。且戰何能無勝負，宜更選精兵，星行倍道，出賊不意，此用兵之奇也。」穎從之。及倫敗，志勸穎曰：「齊王眾號百萬，與張泓等相持不能決，大王逕得濟河，此之大勳，莫之與比，而齊王今當與大王共輔朝政。志聞兩雄不俱處，功名不並立，今宜因太妃微疾，求還定省，推崇齊王，徐結四海之心，此計之上也。」穎納之，遂以母疾還籓，委重於冏。由是穎獲四海之譽，天下歸心。朝廷封志為武強侯，加散騎常侍。","note":"本段具名/明姓；名未知留空，不將爵號或親屬稱謂塞入姓名。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0181","start":181,"end":183,"surface":"趙驤","kind":"person","person_id":"ul5_kh4_xyv","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本篇來源內具名角色；跨篇同指未作肯定。身份審讀：zhaoxiang。","source_identity_role":"zhaoxiang","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#zhaoxiang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005","text":"志字子道，初辟公府掾、尚書郎，出為鄴令。成都王穎之鎮鄴也，愛其才量，委以心膂，遂為謀主。齊王冏起義，遣使告穎。穎召志計事，志曰：「趙王無道，肆行篡逆，四海人神，莫不憤怒。今殿下總率三軍，應期電發，子來之眾，不召自至。掃夷凶逆，必有征無戰。然兵事至重，聖人所慎。宜旌賢任才，以收時望。」穎深然之，改選上佐，高辟掾屬，以志為諮議參軍，仍補左長史，專掌文翰。穎前鋒都督趙驤為倫所敗，士眾震駭，議者多欲還保朝歌。志曰：「今我軍失利，敵新得勝，必有輕易陵轢之情，若頓兵不進，三軍畏衄，懼不可用。且戰何能無勝負，宜更選精兵，星行倍道，出賊不意，此用兵之奇也。」穎從之。及倫敗，志勸穎曰：「齊王眾號百萬，與張泓等相持不能決，大王逕得濟河，此之大勳，莫之與比，而齊王今當與大王共輔朝政。志聞兩雄不俱處，功名不並立，今宜因太妃微疾，求還定省，推崇齊王，徐結四海之心，此計之上也。」穎納之，遂以母疾還籓，委重於冏。由是穎獲四海之譽，天下歸心。朝廷封志為武強侯，加散騎常侍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"rendered_tool_line":197,"capture_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/received-rendered-capture.json","capture_kind":"existing_rendered_text_not_raw","projection":"remove leading ideographic spaces and tool-link wrappers only"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：luzhi。","source_identity_role":"luzhi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#luzhi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子道","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：luzhi。","source_identity_role":"luzhi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#luzhi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"成都王穎","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAC","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：ying。","source_identity_role":"ying","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#ying"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p005:m0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"齊王冏","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIBD","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：jiong。","source_identity_role":"jiong","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered: